{"assets":["/statement-assets/207999309f83785f6ac6606d40005ff87e8cf39b01aabbcf5f0434030c594d6f.png","/statement-assets/d5ac999aa82cdcd8297094d8ada9ec40d09f87f2633f85bc9d163c4a17f81e9c.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"63","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Dividing Island"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A revolution took place on the Buka Island. New government replaced the old one. The new government includes "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" parties and each of them is entitled to some part of the island according to their contribution to the revolution. However, they can't divide the island."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The island can be conventionally represented as two rectangles "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a × b"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c × d"},{"kind":"text","text":" unit squares in size correspondingly. The rectangles are located close to each other. At that, one of the sides with the length of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" and one of the sides with the length of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c"},{"kind":"text","text":" lie on one line. You can see this in more details on the picture."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/207999309f83785f6ac6606d40005ff87e8cf39b01aabbcf5f0434030c594d6f.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th party is entitled to a part of the island equal to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi"},{"kind":"text","text":" unit squares. Every such part should fully cover several squares of the island (it is not allowed to cover the squares partially) and be a connected figure. A \"connected figure\" presupposes that from any square of this party one can move to any other square of the same party moving through edge-adjacent squares also belonging to that party."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to divide the island between parties."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains 5 space-separated integers — "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"d"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ a, b, c, d ≤ 50"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b ≠ d"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 26"},{"kind":"text","text":"). The second line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" space-separated numbers. The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th of them is equal to number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ xi ≤ a × b + c × d"},{"kind":"text","text":"). It is guaranteed that "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/d5ac999aa82cdcd8297094d8ada9ec40d09f87f2633f85bc9d163c4a17f81e9c.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If dividing the island between parties in the required manner is impossible, print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without the quotes). Otherwise, print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (also without the quotes) and, starting from the next line, print "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"max(b, d)"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines each containing "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a + c"},{"kind":"text","text":" characters. To mark what square should belong to what party, use lowercase Latin letters. For the party that is first in order in the input data, use \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", for the second one use \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"b"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and so on. Use \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" for the squares that belong to the sea. The first symbol of the second line of the output data should correspond to the square that belongs to the rectangle "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a × b"},{"kind":"text","text":". The last symbol of the second line should correspond to the square that belongs to the rectangle "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c × d"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If there are several solutions output any."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 4 2 2 3\n5 8 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"YES\naaabb\naabbb\ncbb..\nccb..\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 2 1 4 4\n1 2 3 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"YES\nabbd\ncccd\n...d\n...d\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"63D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/63/problem/D"}